  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1724780996_8142413_6e3e138b8af9c55efdd5d0ce91862c17.png",
  "description": "<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"mf3c-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"mf3c-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"mf3c-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Burke Avenue is a premier skincare brand founded by Craig the Barber, a renowned master barber and grooming expert. Drawing on his extensive experience, as well as the real-life concerns of his clients and readers of his grooming blog, Burke Avenue develops products that naturally combat the negative effects of shaving on the skin.</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"ftmlo-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"ftmlo-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"ftmlo-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">With over </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"ftmlo-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">290+ 5-star customer reviews</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"ftmlo-0-2\"><span data-text=\"true\"> and the prestigious accolade of Best Shave Cream from Men's Health Magazine, Burke Avenue is a trusted name in men's skincare. In fact, our products are so effective that even the women in our customers' lives are eager to use them!</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"9tce0-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"9tce0-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"9tce0-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">___</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"4n0oo-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4n0oo-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"4n0oo-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">PROBLEM: SHAVING IRRITATION</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"2sgld-0-0\">\r\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"2sgld-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"2sgld-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"2sgld-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Cause: </span></span><span data-offset-key=\"2sgld-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\">Skin irritation, darkening (hyperpigmentation), and poor results&mdash;even with the most expensive grooming products. Many grooming products contain moisture-stripping ingredients that dry and darken the skin during shaving, leading to painful and embarrassing razor burn, uneven skin tone, and other sensitivities.</span></span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"f242f-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"f242f-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"f242f-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">SOLUTIONS:</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-ul\" data-offset-key=\"ue61-0-0\">\r\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"ue61-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"ue61-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"ue61-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Moisturizing Shave Cream:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"ue61-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> Created to repair the skin during the aggressive process of shaving while also delivering optimal healing benefits to prepare the skin for the next day&rsquo;s shave.</span></span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"bfkaa-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"bfkaa-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"bfkaa-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">3 in 1 Daily Moisturizer:</span></span><span data-offset-key=\"bfkaa-0-1\"><span data-text=\"true\"> A day and night multidimensional moisturizer that provides immediate relief from shaving irritation and restorative benefits with every use in a lightweight formula.</span></span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"anlh4-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"anlh4-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"anlh4-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">___</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"1062j-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"1062j-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"1062j-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">OUR MISSION</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"editable-rich-text-module__paragraph___3XbpL\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"7j5g6\" data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\">\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">Burke Avenue's mission is to set the global standard in men's skincare by providing products that heal, protect, and enhance skin health while educating and empowering men for better grooming.</span></span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\"></span></span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"anlh4-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">___</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"><span data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"anlh4-0-0\"><span data-text=\"true\">PAYMENT</span></span></span></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\">You will receive monthly payments, with the option for bi-weekly payouts available to our top performers to better manage cash flow, all through your preferred payment method<strong></strong></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"></div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\">We&rsquo;ve set a <strong>Low Payment Threshold</strong> of $50, allowing both new and established affiliates to quickly receive earnings without waiting to accumulate large balances. You can choose from a Diverse Array of Payment Methods, including PayPal, direct deposit, wire transfer, and check, catering to different preferences.</div>\r\n<div data-offset-key=\"4t5bn-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"></div>\r\n</div>",
